OL,3,AUS senators call for investigation into
OL,4,AUkraine's Starlink restrictions
OL,5,
OL,6,FA bipartisan group of US senators has
OL,7,Fsigned a letter demanding an urgent
OL,8,Finvestigation into disruptions to
OL,9,FSpaceX's Starlink internet network in
OL,10,FUkraine.
OL,12,FStarlink is a vital tool allowing Kyiv
OL,13,Fto guide drones to Russian targets and
OL,14,Fprotect its own skies, but on Tuesday
OL,15,Fnight Ukraine said it had unexpectedly
OL,16,Frestricted how fast drones could fly
OL,17,Fwhile maintaining internet connection.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,316,300,200,140,0,100
