OL,3,AUS senators call for investigation into
OL,4,AUkraine's Starlink restrictions
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn the letter, sent to the US defence
OL,7,Fdepartment inspector general, the
OL,8,Fsenators express "grave concern" about
OL,9,Freports of speed curbs between 12 and
OL,10,F14 October.
OL,12,FAsked whether the US might have had a
OL,13,Frole in the slowdown, a US official
OL,14,Ftold the BBC "no such request was ever
OL,15,Fmade by the president [Donald Trump]".
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
